@startuml

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "表示境界" {
  [TranslationJobManagementPage] as Page
  [TranslationJobManagementUseCase] as FrontUseCase
  [TranslationJobManagementGatewayContract] as FrontContract
}

package "backend 操作境界" {
  [translationJobManagementController] as Controller
  [TranslationJobManagementUseCase] as BackendUseCase
  [TranslationJobManagementService\n状態投影と操作可否] as Service
}

package "状態保存境界" {
  [JobLifecycleRepository\n変更対象] as JobRepo
  [TranslationSourceRepository\n接続先] as SourceRepo
  database "TRANSLATION_JOB\nJOB_PHASE_RUN" as JobTables
}

Page --> FrontUseCase : 一覧、詳細、操作
FrontUseCase --> FrontContract : job state contract
FrontContract --> Controller : Wails DTO
Controller --> BackendUseCase : request / response
BackendUseCase --> Service : query / command
Service --> JobRepo : job state と phase run
Service --> SourceRepo : input と cache 状態
JobRepo --> JobTables : read / delete / update

note right of Service
  一覧表示は状態を変えない。
  削除は非実行中だけ許可する。
  停止と再開は入口投影に留める。
end note

@enduml

